			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1786628747605,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "M1:\nRequest Id -> 0 to M-1\nh(request_id) -> m%n\nh(x) -> hash functopn\nn -> Number of Server\nX/n load\nLoad Factor -> 1/n",
			"rawText": "M1:\nRequest Id -> 0 to M-1\nh(request_id) -> m%n\nh(x) -> hash functopn\nn -> Number of Server\nX/n load\nLoad Factor -> 1/n",
